Merge branch 'main' into build-css

* main:
  Move locale pack from private/ to @uppy/locales (#5801)
  Move private/upload-cdn into packages/uppy (#5800)
  Revert "@uppy/core: resolve stale state issue in checkAndUpdateFileState (#5806)"
  @uppy/locales: update Swedish translations (#5807)
  @uppy/core: resolve stale state issue in checkAndUpdateFileState (#5806)
  @uppy/vue: use markRaw() for uppy class in context provider (#5809)
  fix ReferenceError: h is not defined
  @uppy/webcam: add image preview and discard (#5797)
  Replace custom contributions script with simple image

Merge branch 'main' into turbo

* main:
  Isolate CSS building per package (#5799)
  Move locale pack from private/ to @uppy/locales (#5801)
  Move private/upload-cdn into packages/uppy (#5800)
  Revert "@uppy/core: resolve stale state issue in checkAndUpdateFileState (#5806)"
  @uppy/locales: update Swedish translations (#5807)
  @uppy/core: resolve stale state issue in checkAndUpdateFileState (#5806)
  @uppy/vue: use markRaw() for uppy class in context provider (#5809)
  fix ReferenceError: h is not defined
  @uppy/webcam: add image preview and discard (#5797)
  Replace custom contributions script with simple image

